1. SCOPE / 适用范围
================================================================================

This license covers every file in this repository: documentation (README.md,
README.zh-CN.md, DEPLOY.md, DEPLOY.zh-CN.md), measurement data
(data/benchmark.csv), the ComfyUI workflow (workflow/minimax_h3_ref2v_8gb.json),
the monitoring script (tools/monitor.py), and the placeholder image
(assets/example.png).

本许可适用于本仓库的全部文件：文档（README.md、README.zh-CN.md、DEPLOY.md、
DEPLOY.zh-CN.md）、实测数据（data/benchmark.csv）、ComfyUI 工作流
（workflow/minimax_h3_ref2v_8gb.json）、监控脚本（tools/monitor.py）以及占位图
（assets/example.png）。

Model weights are NOT part of this repository and are NOT covered by this
license. They remain governed by the MiniMax-H3 Community License Agreement:
https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3

